{"5053650":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Colsword","steam_appid":5053650,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[5101850],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >COLSWORD is a logic puzzle game where you paint cubes in the right sequence using enchanted colored swords. Plan every move carefully: the order in which you strike can be the key to solving each challenge.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the unique abilities of your swords, uncover new strategies, and turn every board into a colorful victory.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 56 increasingly challenging levels  <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Easy to learn, hard to master<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash the full power of your swords.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >COLSWORD is a logic puzzle game where you paint cubes in the right sequence using enchanted colored swords. Plan every move carefully: the order in which you strike can be the key to solving each challenge.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the unique abilities of your swords, uncover new strategies, and turn every board into a colorful victory.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 56 increasingly challenging levels  <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Easy to learn, hard to master<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash the full power of your swords.<\/p>","short_description":"COLSWORD is a logic puzzle game where you paint cubes in the right sequence using enchanted colored swords.","supported_languages":"English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Traditional Chinese, Simplified Chinese, Korean, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Japanese","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5053650\/f04e880c315534b5b0b1881fb4eabd4ad01be548\/header.jpg?t=1793639268","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5053650\/ceb216d68e56d95356370052ee6df2bdc2adf6fe\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793639268","capsule_imagev5":"